## 3. Architecture

- **Single screen-stack SPA.** Every page is a `<section class="step" id="stepX">`. `show(id)` (4870) toggles `.active`; `go(id)` (4878) pushes onto the stack; `back()` (4894) pops; `resetTo(ids)` (4885) lands on a page with fresh history.
- **Green status bar** — `show()` flips the fake status bar to green on steps marked `data-green`: `stepAccount` (4302), `stepGrpCreate` (4369), `stepGrpPocket` (4436), `stepIndCreate` (4449), `stepIndPocket` (4506). While viewing a **closed** account the bar turns muted grey instead.
- **One store.** `S` (4831) is loaded from sessionStorage by `loadState()` (4823), written back by `save()` (4838); `assets/prototype-mode.js` clears `fdState` when a new prototype run starts.
- **One keypad, three journeys.** `amountMode = 'fd' | 'ind' | 'grp'` routes the shared amount screen (`paintAmount` 5478 / `amountContinue` 5523) to fixed-deposit, pocket and group maths.
- **Interest is derived, never stored.** Every balance and interest figure is recomputed from `opened`, `rate`, `principal` and the transaction list at render time, so the demo stays internally consistent on any date.
- **Receipts are shared.** `receiptHtml(o)` (5709) builds the common result card (status chip, M-PESA + partner duo mark inside a progress ring, headline figures, optional copyable transaction ID, detail rows, `stamp()` 5684 date/time). `showInfo()` (5736) shows a non-terminal receipt; `showDone()` (5745) shows a terminal one.
- **One card header everywhere.** `cardHead(kind, right, pct, ringColor, title, chip, pair)` (5181) draws the top line of every saving card from the `KIND` map (5171 — colour class, label and icon per product), optionally wrapping the icon in a progress ring or replacing it with the bank + M-PESA pair (`duoProgress`, 5090).
- **One empty state everywhere.** `emptyState(icon, title, text, plus)` (5051) backed by the copy map `EMPTY` (5056) and `noPocket(kind)` (5063) — see §9.

