## 6. Savings home — "Mine" view

Markup 4030–4086 · `renderHome()` (4945) · list in `renderSavingsList()` (5006)

- **Pinned balance card** — wrapped in `.home-pin` (markup 4049; CSS 393–417) with `position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 2` and a white fade (`::after`) so the card stays put while the list scrolls under it and dissolves into the fade.
  - `TOTAL SAVINGS BALANCE`, an **eye** (`toggleMineHidden`, 4940 — masks to `*****`, drops the slash, flips the `aria-label` between Hide and Show), the total, then **Accrued Interest** and **Active Accounts**.
  - A chart button top-right → **Savings activity** (`openActivity`, 7988).
- **Header row** — back arrow (`back()`), the title `SAVINGS` / `FIXED DEPOSIT`, the **notifications bell with an unread badge** (`homeBell` 4036, `paintBell` 8124) and the **⋮ menu** (`openMenu`, 6345).
- **Totals** (4952–4959): `Σ pocket balances + Σ my group shares + Σ live fixed principals`; accrued interest = fixed `accrued` **+** pocket interest; active accounts = pockets + open deposits + open groups. `renderHome()` also renders the fixed pane (4965), so both views are always in step.
- **Four product tiles** → `openType('individual' | 'target' | 'fixed' | 'group')` (5061). The **FIXED** tile carries a **NEW** badge (`#tileNew`, 4074) until savings are activated.
- **ACTIVE SAVING ACCOUNTS** header (4082) with a **FILTER** dropdown (`openListPicker` 4990 · `toggleListKind` 4980 · `renderListPicker` 4996). The label reads `All`, one kind's name, or "N kinds"; cards render in `LIST_KINDS` order regardless of the order the filter was ticked; matured deposits sort after still-locked ones.
- **Empty state** — `noPocket(kind)` (5049) shows the right icon, title and one-liner for the visible filter (§9).
- **Bottom CTA** — `NEW SAVING` (4093) → `homeCta()` (4926) → `chooseSavingType()` (6711): a sheet offering the four products in their kind colours and icons.

**Card contents**

| Card | Renders |
|---|---|
| `indCard` (6871) | compact / full pocket card: kind icon + name, `SAVED`, % of goal and progress bar (amber when **BEHIND**), days left, `AUTO-SAVE` or `INDIVIDUAL` chip, and the auto-save line (e.g. "3,500 ETB weekly · next 1 Nov 2026") |
| `depositCard` (5181) | bank + M-PESA pair with the M-PESA mark riding the progress ring, deposit name, `LOCKED` / `MATURED` / `CLOSED` chip, rate, and a footer of `N Days Left` + `x%` · `Matured <date>` + "Ready to collect" · `Closed <date>` + "X ETB PAID"; closed cards read `WAS` instead of `SAVED` and drop the interest line |
| `groupCard` (7275) | kind icon + group name, `x%` rate line, chip, `SAVED` / % of target, footer "You manage this group" or "Managed by Hana Girma", or the leave-request progress ("2 of 3 approved") |

