## 8. Saving-type first page

`openType(kind)` (5061) · `renderType()` (5094) · `stepType` (4332)

| Product | Title | Card label | CTA |
|---|---|---|---|
| target | TARGET SAVINGS | TOTAL TARGET SAVINGS | NEW TARGET SAVING → `openIndCreate('target')` |
| individual | INDIVIDUAL SAVINGS | TOTAL INDIVIDUAL SAVINGS | NEW INDIVIDUAL SAVING → `openIndCreate()` |
| fixed | FIXED DEPOSIT | TOTAL LOCKED SAVINGS | NEW FIXED DEPOSIT → `startNewDeposit()` |
| group | GROUP SAVINGS | TOTAL GROUP SAVINGS | NEW GROUP → `openGroupCreate()` |

- A big total card with an eye (`toggleTypeHidden`, 5068) and an adaptive stat pair: the left figure is **Target Amount** (target), **Total Accrued Interest** (fixed), **Accrued Interest** (individual) or **Members** (group); **Active Accounts** always sits on the right.
- Any live **leave request** surfaces here as a `leaveCard` (5144).
- **ACTIVE ACCOUNTS** — the list in full (`typeRow` 5087 → the matching card in full, bar and footer included), or `noPocket(typeKind)` (5146) when the product has nothing yet.

