## 14. Group saving

**Create** — `openGroupCreate()` (7288) · `paintGrpForm()` (7299) · `grpCreate()` (7393) · `runGrpCreate()` (7404) · `stepGrpCreate` (4355, `data-green`)

- Fields: **name** (max 15 characters with a live `n/15` counter), **target** (≥ 500), **target date**, and **at least one member**. I am added automatically as **admin**.
- **Member picker** — `openMemberSheet` (7330) · `renderMemberSheet` (7337), two sections:
  - **ADD BY M-PESA NUMBER** — `addByNumber()` (7364) accepts any 9-digit number starting with `7` (`/^7\d{8}$/`), rejects a bad number with *"M-PESA numbers have 9 digits and start with 7"* and a duplicate with *"X is already added"*, and stores unknown numbers as name = formatted phone (`fmtPhone`, 7261) with an initials avatar.
  - **CONTACTS** — the five seeded people; anyone already in the group renders locked and non-tappable (`toggleMember`, 7358).
  - Chips on the create form remove a draft member (`removeDraft`, 7321); the sheet button reads `DONE (n)` / `ADD TO GROUP (n)` (`memberDone`, 7377).
- PIN context rows — **GROUP NAME, TARGET, BY, MEMBERS N including you** → CREATING YOUR GROUP (create account, send invitations) → the group page plus a **"GROUP CREATED SUCCESSFULLY"** sheet with ADD LATER / CONTRIBUTE, and an SMS listing the invitees.

**Group page** — `openGroup(id)` (7431) · `renderGrpPocket()` (7437) · `stepGrpPocket` (4422, `data-green`)

- Hero card: name + eye, balance, "of X ETB target", status chip, progress bar, "N days to <date> · percent", *"N members · you put in X ETB"*, and the recurring-transfer line when set.
- Actions: **CONTRIBUTE**; **WITHDRAW** for the admin (muted while locked); **RECURRING**; **MEMBERS** for non-admins (`showGrpMembers`, 7499 — scrolls to the list).
- A state card explains who may take money out and when: **READY TO WITHDRAW** ("The group reached its target." / "The target date has come.") or "**YOU MANAGE THIS GROUP** / MANAGED BY HANA GIRMA" with the rule *"can withdraw once the target is reached or on <date>"*.
- **Withdrawal rule** — `grpCanWithdraw(g)` (7264): `admin && !closed && balance > 0 && (balance ≥ target || today ≥ target date)`.
- **MEMBERS** — sorted by contribution with pending invitations last, each with their % of the group and `YOU` / `ADMIN` / `LEAVING` / `PENDING` chips.
- **TRANSACTIONS** with per-member attribution (`nameOf`, 7622) and a compact empty state (7492), plus the leave card whenever a request is live.

**Contribute** — `openGrpContribute()` (7860) · `paintGrpAmount()` (7868) · `grpAmountContinue()` (7886) → the shared keypad with the wallet limit → PIN → `runGrpMove(true, n)` (7918): credits the group, debits the wallet, records a DEPOSIT by `me`, then the result screen and an SMS with the group balance against the target.

**Group withdrawal** — `grpWithdraw()` (7896): blocked with a toast *"WITHDRAW OPENS AT THE TARGET OR ON <date>"* until eligible; otherwise a **CONFIRM WITHDRAWAL** receipt (opening balance, FROM GROUP SAVINGS, SEND TO M-PESA WALLET, MEMBERS, "AFTER THIS: GROUP CLOSES"), PIN, then `runGrpMove(false, n)` — the admin takes the whole pot and the group closes.

**Admin tools** — `openManageGroup()` (7504): **EDIT GROUP** (`openGrpEdit` 7544 / `paintGrpEdit` 7553 / `saveGrpEdit` 7567 — name, target and date, validated, with an SMS to members), **ADD MEMBERS** (`openMemberSheet(g)`), and **MEMBERS** where tapping one opens `memberActions()` (7520) → `askRemoveMember()` (7532), which warns *"What they already put in stays in the group."* before removing them.

**Close group** — `askCloseGroup()` (7579) / `runCloseGroup(g)` (7594): every member is paid back their own share, my share comes to my wallet, the group is marked closed with `paid` recorded and the balance zeroed; the result screen reads *"<name> is closed. Every member got back what they put in."* and an SMS goes out.

---

## 15. Group invitations

- New members are stored with **`pending: true`** (`memberDone` 7377; `runGrpCreate` 7404). `joined(g)` (7246) counts accepted members, `invitedCount(g)` (7247) counts pending ones, and `membersLine(g)` (7248) reads e.g. "3 members · 1 invited".
- The member list shows a `PENDING` chip and the line "Pending invitation" for them, and they sort after everyone who has joined.
- **As the invitee** — `?invite=c4` (sidebar: *"Daniel B – Invited"*) → `inviteePrompt()` (8180) after 700 ms:
  - an SMS arrives (*"M-PESA: Mikias invited you to join Family Trip. Open M-PESA Saving to accept."*, marked `forOther` so it stays out of my notifications);
  - then a **GROUP INVITATION** sheet with the inviter, the member count, *"Save together toward 60,000 ETB by <date>. Your money earns 7% interest from the day you put it in."* and **DECLINE** / **ACCEPT**;
  - if no invitation exists: toast **"NO INVITATION FOR DANIEL BEKELE YET"**.
- `answerInvite(id, yes)` (8199): ACCEPT clears `pending` (toast **JOINED AS DANIEL BEKELE**); DECLINE removes the member (toast **DECLINED AS DANIEL BEKELE**). Either way it stores `S.pendingNotice`, so the **next time the admin opens Savings** an in-app notice reports *"Daniel Bekele accepted/declined your invitation to Family Trip."*

---

## 16. Leaving a group — the approval flow

`LEAVE_NEEDED = 3` (7619). A member cannot simply walk away: **three other members must approve**, and they are paid back everything they put in plus interest.

| Step | Function | Behaviour |
|---|---|---|
| Ask | `askLeaveGroup()` (7685) | a dialog explaining the mechanics, then PIN, then the request is recorded as `leave = { who: 'me', approvals: [] }`, toast **LEAVE REQUEST SENT**, an SMS to the other members, and the simulated approvals begin |
| Approvals tick in | `othersApprove(g)` (7707) | walks the other members (admin first) and approves one every **3.6 s**, so the demo completes itself |
| The card | `leaveCard(g, withGroup)` (7634) | **REQUEST SENT** with an approval-dots gauge (`approvalDots`, 7624) for the requester; **ACTION REQUIRED** with **APPROVE** for approvers (and **DECLINE**, admin only); hidden while the demo sheet is up |
| Who has approved | `showApprovers(id)` (7666) | the **APPROVALS** sheet: everyone listed as APPROVED or WAITING, approved first then admins |
| Approve | `confirmApprove()` (7732) → `approveLeave(id, g)` (7717) | PIN (MEMBER, GROUP, PAID BACK) → the approval is recorded and reported by SMS; completing at 3 |
| Complete | `completeLeave(g)` (7764) | for **me**: the wallet is credited my share and the group is removed from `S.groups`, with a **LEAVE APPROVED** sheet and an SMS; for **another member**: `balance -= paid`, a WITHDRAW transaction labelled *"<name> left the group"*, the member is removed, a toast and an SMS |
| Decline | `declineLeave()` (7746) | only the admin can — the request is dropped, the money stays, and the member is told by SMS |

**Group Saving Demo** — `demoLeavePrompt` (7803) · `demoReview` (7826) · `demoDeclines` (7853)

`DEMO_GROUP = 'GS30215547'` (Family Trip). `?demo=me|c1|c3` sets the viewer, opens the **group first page**, sends *"M-PESA: Daniel Bekele asked to leave Family Trip. Open M-PESA Saving to approve or decline."*, and after **1.4 s** raises the **LEAVE REQUEST** sheet — Daniel's avatar, *"X ETB goes back to them, with interest"*, *"N of 3 members have approved."* and **DECIDE LATER** / **CONTINUE**.

- CONTINUE → `demoReview`: a **LEAVE REQUEST / REVIEW REQUEST** receipt (MEMBER, PAID BACK, SAVED, INTEREST EARNED, GROUP, APPROVALS), then the APPROVE confirm page and PIN → `approveLeave(viewerId, g)`; a non-admin viewer also sees the toast **YOU APPROVED**.
- DECLINE as the admin runs the real `declineLeave()`; a non-admin viewer just gets **YOU DECLINED**, because only the admin's decision is binding.

