| Component | Reference | Behaviour |
|---|---|---|
| **Bottom sheet** | `openSheet(o)` (8068) · `closeSheet()` (8085) | one reusable sheet (`#sheetBody`): grab handle, label, hero (logo/icon/title/text), optional raw html, note, then actions in a row or stacked; tapping the scrim closes it |
| **Confirm dialog** | `openDialog(title, html, onConfirm, label)` (6374) · `closeDialog()` (6382) | centred modal with an overridable confirm label — `CLOSE`, `REMOVE`, `STOP`, `REQUEST`, `DECLINE` — and a CANCEL that dismisses |
| **PIN** | `askPin(ctx)` (5570) → `checkPin()` (5600) | title + context rows, four dots, keypad, fingerprint; 3 attempts, shake on failure, "locked" sheet at zero |
| **Processing** | `processing(title, steps, then)` (5634) | blocking overlay with rotating labelled steps, 700 ms each, then the callback |
| **Receipts** | `receiptHtml(o)` (5695) · `showInfo()` (5722) · `showDone()` (5731) | chip, M-PESA + partner duo mark inside a progress ring, headline figures, copyable transaction ID, detail rows and a `stamp()` date/time; `showDone` also fires the SMS and the exit step |
| **⋮ menu** | `openMenu(where)` (6345) · `closeMenu()` (6371) | context-aware: ACTIVITY + FAQS on the Mine view; FAQS + CLOSE ACCOUNT on the fixed view and on a deposit; FAQS + CLOSE ACCOUNT on a pocket; FAQS + MANAGE GROUP + CLOSE GROUP (admin) or FAQS + LEAVE GROUP / LEAVE REQUESTED (member) on a group. Disabled items render greyed |
| **Status bar** | `show(id)` (4856) | white on light screens, green on `data-green` screens, muted grey while viewing a closed account |
| **Hide-balance eyes** | `toggleMineHidden` (4940) · `toggleLocked` (5211) · `toggleTypeHidden` (5068) · `acctEye` (5852) | mask figures to `*****`; the account-page flag is shared across the deposit, pocket and group pages |
| **Date picker** | `openDatePicker` (6579) → `dpConfirm` (6658) | three-wheel day / month / year sheet with quick chips and a live day count |
| **Keypads** | `amountPress` (5452) · `pinPress` (5586) | shared digit pads; `digitsOnly` (6706) strips non-digits and leading zeros from typed fields |
| **Number inputs** | `moneyInput` (6697) · `fmtInput` (6702) · `numVal` (6704) | thousands-grouped entry fields that are read back as plain numbers |
| **Physical keyboard** | 8236 | digits type, Backspace deletes, **Enter** continues on the amount screen, **Esc** goes back; ignored inside inputs, sheets, dialogs and while processing |

